# UC4-发送消息用例图

flowchart LR
    actor "用户" as User
    rectangle "发送模块" as Send {
        card "输入内容" as C1
        card "非空验证" as C2
        card "发送请求" as C3
        card "建立SSE" as C4
        card "流式接收" as C5
        card "渲染消息" as C6
    }

    User --> C1
    C1 --> C2
    C2 -->|为空| C1
    C2 -->|有效| C3
    C3 --> C4
    C4 --> C5
    C5 --> C6